{
  "key": 22275,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, hello!\r",
        "It’s said that past this hole used to be\n",
        "a huge tower reaching far into the sky.\r",
        "They say that it was a rather strange\n",
        "tower with half of it embedded\f",
        "in the cliff.\r",
        "It was not just a tall tower reaching\n",
        "up to the sky, but also reaching deep\f",
        "down underground!\r",
        "It is rumored that it even reached the\n",
        "bottom of the ocean!\r",
        "In short, the ruins used to connect\n",
        "the sky, the land, and the\f",
        "sea to each other...\r",
        "Most of the tower is now crumbled,\n",
        "and the only things that remain are\f",
        "the entrance and its interior, where\f",
        "you’ll see strange patterns."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "I think this building may have been\n",
        "built to enshrine Pokémon with\f",
        "a strong connection to the sea,\f",
        "the land, and the sky."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "A masked guy who looks great in front\n",
        "of a huge torrential waterfall...\f",
        "That’s me, Crasher Wake!\r",
        "Who dares to talk to me so freely?\r",
        "Oh!\n",
        "You are that mask-fanatic Trainer\f",
        "I saw at the Celadon Dept. Store!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: I heard about the great\n",
        "waterfall near Cianwood and decided\f",
        "to come see it.\r",
        "This waterfall is awesome!\r",
        "No human or Pokémon can survive\n",
        "without water, yet that same water\f",
        "can sometimes cause great suffering.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: You must be a Trainer from this\n",
        "region, right?\r",
        "I hope you’ll become a Trainer\n",
        "with the qualities of water--\f",
        "strong, tough to beat, yet\f",
        "refreshing.\r",
        "Good luck, mask-fanatic {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Chuck: Ooomph!\n",
        "You came all this way just to see me?\r",
        "Then you might as well take a\n",
        "picture with me, too. Yes?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Chuck: Say cheese!\n",
        "Don’t close your eyes!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Chuck: Great picture!\n",
        "This wil be a good memory for you, too!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Chuck: No? You came all the way\n",
        "just to say no?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC and delete\n",
        "some pictures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00010",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} found a note from Baoba!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} read the note.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I hope this reaches you.\r",
        "There are five trainers here already\n",
        "helping to defeat Team Rocket.\r",
        "They’ve been informed of your arrival.\n",
        "Team up with them, and defeat our foe!\r",
        "Best of luck.\n",
        "Baoba."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Oh! You must be {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Baoba asked Mira and her companions for\n",
        "help, but he’s now stuck at the Safari\f",
        "Zone. Mira never saw him, but she did\f",
        "hear a Trainer called {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} would\f",
        "be arriving!\r",
        "Help Mira defeat these guys!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Defeat us?\n",
        "We’ll see about that, punk!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "...Gah!\n",
        "Retreat!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Thanks! There’s more of Team\n",
        "Rocket up ahead, though.\r",
        "Mira will heal your Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Keep going! There’s even more\n",
        "Team Rocket members ahead!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00017",
      "en_US": "Alakazam: Kazaa!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "This Team Rocket designed boulder\n",
        "refuses to budge!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Upon inspection, the boulder cracked\n",
        "and shattered."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: Aha! I was wondering when you\n",
        "would arrive!\r",
        "We came to help, but there’s more of\n",
        "these Rocket goons than we can handle\f",
        "alone... But, now you’re here!\r",
        "Let’s take ’em down!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00021",
      "en_US": "Brats! Rats! Gnats!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Yaa! Master Archer won’t be happy\n",
        "with us..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: Ehehehe! That was a smoking-hot\n",
        "battle! It’s not over yet, though!\r",
        "Lemme heal your Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: Baoba is still in the Safari\n",
        "Zone Gate. You better help him!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00025",
      "en_US": "Claydol: Cuuwaydol!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Ah, you must be {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "I was told of your arrival, but I’m\n",
        "surprised to see you so soon!\r",
        "May we defeat these goons?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "The Safari Zone is ours!\n",
        "You aren’t taking it back!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00028",
      "en_US": "No way! How did we get beaten?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Thank you for your help.\n",
        "You have my gratitude.\r",
        "I’ll heal your Pokémon as thanks!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00030",
      "en_US": "Cheryl: The Safari Zone must be saved!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00031",
      "en_US": "Blissey: Buhliss!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: I’ve been waiting for you...\r",
        "We were able to hold them off...\n",
        "But we couldn’t defeat them...\f",
        "But now you’re here... We can.\f",
        "That makes me happy...\r",
        "Now, we should defeat these people...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "Some shy girl and a kid aren’t\n",
        "going to beat us!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00034",
      "en_US": "Ayeeh! What just happened!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: Thank you... I appreciate it...\n",
        "Just a bit...\r",
        "I’ll heal your Pokémon up...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: Bye-bye...\n",
        "You’re almost there..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00037",
      "en_US": "Arcanine: Arrrrrrrrr!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00038",
      "en_US": [
        "Ariana: Hold it!\r",
        "You’ve gone far enough on this heroic\n",
        "journey. Get ready for a thrashing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00039",
      "en_US": [
        "Ariana: Tch... For a brat, you’re\n",
        "very strong. I must inform Archer..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00040",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: Were you expecting a\n",
        "double battle...?\r",
        "I already beat the Rockets..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0407_R47_00041",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh?\r",
        "Ariana seems to have dropped\n",
        "something...\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
